    <detaileddescription>
<para>This example shows the visual differences between linear, square-root, and physical pigment-based (Mixbox) color blending.</para>
<para>Output results: <image type="html" name="ex_mixbox_linear.png">Linear Blending</image>
 <image type="html" name="ex_mixbox_sqrt.png">Square-root Average Blending</image>
 <image type="html" name="ex_mixbox_mixbox.png">Mixbox Blending</image>
